      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-329019",
      ":question/problem": "A table shows the number of subscribers to a newsletter for six different years.\n\n| Year | Subscribers |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $2015$ | $3600$ |\n| $2016$ | $4200$ |\n| $2017$ | $5000$ |\n| $2018$ | $4600$ |\n| $2019$ | $3800$ |\n| $2021$ | $3000$ |\n\nWhat was the percentage decrease in subscribers from $2017$ to $2021$?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
